{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25387","headline":"清冷池怀古 · 李德裕","name":"清冷池怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"区囿三百里，常闻驷马来。\n旌旗朝甬道，箫鼓燕平台。\n追昔赋文雅，从容游上才。\n竹园秋水净，风苑雪烟开。\n牛祸衅将发，羊孙谋始回。\n袁丝徒伏劒，长孺欲成灰。\n兴废由所感，湮沦斯可哀。\n空留故池鴈，刷羽尚徘徊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25387.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25387","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}